WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.768
Welcome to Cursor Community Welcome — a configurable animated welcome screen for workshops and events.

2
00:00:06.768 --> 00:00:15.672
The landing stage opens with the Cursor logo, chapter brand, word-by-word heading, live date, and a floating particle backdrop.

3
00:00:15.672 --> 00:00:23.712
Top-right controls let organizers edit content, enter presentation preview, or share a link with the current configuration.

4
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:33.744
Open the editor to customize brand, title, date, auto-replay interval, and up to five sponsors — or reset to defaults when you need a clean slate.

5
00:00:33.744 --> 00:00:42.624
Keyboard shortcuts keep presentation smooth — press E to open the editor, F or P for fullscreen preview, and Escape to close.

6
00:00:42.624 --> 00:00:53.400
Shared links and local storage restore your configuration — custom brand, heading, fixed event date, replay interval, and sponsor chips — without touching code.

7
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:59.688
Sponsor chips appear on the welcome stage with a title and name for each partner, up to five entries.

8
00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:06.504
Share copies a URL that encodes the current configuration so teammates open the same welcome screen instantly.

9
00:01:06.504 --> 00:01:13.008
Preview enters presentation mode so the welcome animation fills the screen without editor chrome.

10
00:01:13.008 --> 00:01:19.896
The footer credits the crafter and links back to Cursor — a polished close for every community session.
